---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story"
  description="A letter from our founder, Lenga — the story and purpose behind Salt & Sun Tours in Swakopmund and Walvis Bay, Namibia."
>
  <Section
    eyebrow="Salt & Sun Tours"
    heading="More Than a Journey"
    theme="photo"
    align="center"
    imageUrl="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1667254650752-34cdd1106dc9?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&q=80&w=1920"
    imageCredit={{ name: 'Joshua Kettle', username: 'joshuakettle' }}
  >
    <p>A letter from our founder, Lenga.</p>
  </Section>

  <article class="letter">
    <div class="letter__body">
      <p class="letter__intro">My name is Lenga, and Lenga means King.</p>

      <p>
        My roots are in Etosha, where the earth carries one of Namibia's
        greatest wonders — the Etosha salt pan. That is where the heart of
        Salt &amp; Sun Tours begins: from the salt of the earth, under the
        Namibian sun, and grounded in a purpose greater than tourism.
      </p>

      <p>Our foundation is inspired by Matthew 5:13–16 — to be salt and light in the world.</p>

      <p>
        For us, a tour is not simply about driving through the dunes,
        watching wildlife, camping beneath the stars, enjoying a picnic, or
        experiencing the thrill of an adventure.
      </p>

      <p class="letter__emphasis">It is about the person you become along the way.</p>

      <p>
        Life leaves people carrying stories that are often never spoken —
        pain, disappointment, loss, rejection, fear, and experiences that
        shape who we become. My own journey taught me that sometimes
        healing begins when we finally have a safe place to be heard.
      </p>

      <p>That is what we want Salt &amp; Sun Tours to be.</p>

      <ul class="letter__lines">
        <li>A place where strangers can become companions.</li>
        <li>Where conversations go deeper than the road ahead.</li>
        <li>Where stories can be shared without judgement.</li>
        <li>
          Where we can laugh, reflect, encourage one another, and sometimes
          simply sit in silence beneath the African sky.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="letter__emphasis">
        You may arrive looking for Namibia.<br />
        You may leave having found a little more of yourself.
      </p>

      <p>
        We believe that every person has value, regardless of their past,
        their mistakes, or what they have been through. And sometimes, one
        person's testimony can become another person's reason to keep
        going.
      </p>

      <p class="letter__emphasis">
        So when you travel with us, you are not just booking a tour.<br />
        You are joining a journey of connection, discovery, healing and
        transformation.
      </p>

      <ul class="letter__lines letter__lines--calls">
        <li>Come experience the salt.</li>
        <li>Feel the sun.</li>
        <li>Meet the wilderness.</li>
        <li>Share the journey.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        And perhaps, somewhere between the desert and the stars, you will
        discover that the greatest destination was never a place — it was
        becoming who you were created to be.
      </p>

      <p class="letter__signature">
        Salt &amp; Sun Tours
        <span>More than a tour. A journey that leaves a mark.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="letter__cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tours">Explore our tours</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .letter {
    max-width: var(--content-width-narrow);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-md);
  }

  .letter__body p {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: var(--lh-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .letter__intro,
  .letter__emphasis {
    font-family: var(--font-display-italic);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    color: var(--color-earth-900) !important;
  }

  .letter__lines {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0 var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .letter__lines li {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: var(--lh-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .letter__lines--calls {
    border-left-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .letter__lines--calls li {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
  }

  .letter__signature {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg) !important;
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    color: var(--color-earth-900) !important;
  }

  .letter__signature span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-3xs);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .letter__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
